<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-BBB-</p>
<p>Exedy Corp, 2.5 billion yen unsecured due 2001</p>
<p>-BB-</p>
<p>Furukawa Electric Co Ltd,</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2003</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2006</p>
<p>Shinshu Jusco Co Ltd, three billion yen unsecured</p>
<p>due 2000  </p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Kobe Steel Ltd, 20 billion yen unsecured due 2011</p>
<p>Mitsui O.S.K. Lines Ltd,</p>
<p>10 billion unsecured due 2002</p>
<p>10 billion unsecured due 2006</p>
<p>-CCC-</p>
<p>Tomen Corp, 10 billion yen unsecured due 2002</p>
</text>
